    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for user error types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Users should declare their error types like:</para>
<para>class MyError : public <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error_info" kindref="compound">ErrorInfo&lt;MyError&gt;</ref> { .... };</para>
<para>This class provides an implementation of the ErrorInfoBase::kind method, which is used by the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error" kindref="compound">Error</ref> RTTI system. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
